# This repository keeps source-code whitespace checks enabled.
#
# The byte-exact `-text` pins that used to live here referenced the regenerable
# tool evidence under evidence/ and the force-added release bitstreams under
# releases/. Those trees were removed during the repository consolidation
# (see docs/B链-构建与复现.md); every one of them could be regenerated by
# re-running the board flow.

# V3 vendor provenance and raw evidence use SHA-256 of the actual file bytes.
# Disable newline conversion for these immutable inputs/transcripts; retain
# normal source-code whitespace checks everywhere.
/safevision/platform/anlogic_eg4s20_hx4s20c/ip/hdmi_vendor/** -text
/safevision/platform/anlogic_eg4s20_hx4s20c/ip/pll/sv_v3_memory_pll* -text
/safevision/verification/experiments/** -text
/evidence/v3/** -text
